{"schema_version": 1, "event": "case_completed", "at": "2026-11-09T07:52:19.857738+00:00", "result": {"id": "cross-01", "category": "cross", "user": "tw-ops", "cited_ok": true, "queries": ["泵組壓力不足 P03-11 處理", "P03-11 故障碼"], "answer": "P03-11 表示泵組壓力不足 [S1]。手冊給出的處置步驟是：\n\n1. 檢查進水閥是否全開 [S2]\n2. 清洗濾網 [S2]\n3. 若壓力仍不足，更換密封圈，型號 SEAL-9X [S2]\n\n另外，日常檢查章節要求每週檢查泵組振動與異響 [S1]。", "error_code": null, "first_answer_chunk_ms": 2172.985, "review_snapshot": {"schema_version": 1, "question": "泵組壓力不足 P03-11 怎麼處理", "answer": "P03-11 表示泵組壓力不足 [S1]。手冊給出的處置步驟是：\n\n1. 檢查進水閥是否全開 [S2]\n2. 清洗濾網 [S2]\n3. 若壓力仍不足，更換密封圈，型號 SEAL-9X [S2]\n\n另外，日常檢查章節要求每週檢查泵組振動與異響 [S1]。", "evidence": [{"alias": "S1", "chunk_id": "96e73d99eb9a4d4b9b5d22cbaf7bab5e", "document_id": "506f924476874054be7775681c66b633", "document_title": "泵组维护手册", "revision": 1, "page": 1, "section_path": "泵组维护手册 > 泵组日常检查", "text": "每周检查泵组振动与异响。故障码 P03-11 表示泵组压力不足。", "lang": "zh-Hans"}, {"alias": "S2", "chunk_id": "7c1669ad838646fa9509d6c799897d79", "document_id": "506f924476874054be7775681c66b633", "document_title": "泵组维护手册", "revision": 1, "page": 2, "section_path": "泵组维护手册 > 故障码 P03-11 处置", "text": "1. 检查进水阀是否全开。\n2. 清洗滤网。\n3. 压力仍不足时更换密封圈，型号 SEAL-9X。", "lang": "zh-Hans"}], "sources": [{"alias": "S1", "chunk_id": "96e73d99eb9a4d4b9b5d22cbaf7bab5e", "document_id": "506f924476874054be7775681c66b633", "document_title": "泵组维护手册", "revision": 1, "page": 1, "section_path": "泵组维护手册 > 泵组日常检查", "text": "每周检查泵组振动与异响。故障码 P03-11 表示泵组压力不足。", "lang": "zh-Hans"}, {"alias": "S2", "chunk_id": "7c1669ad838646fa9509d6c799897d79", "document_id": "506f924476874054be7775681c66b633", "document_title": "泵组维护手册", "revision": 1, "page": 2, "section_path": "泵组维护手册 > 故障码 P03-11 处置", "text": "1. 检查进水阀是否全开。\n2. 清洗滤网。\n3. 压力仍不足时更换密封圈，型号 SEAL-9X。", "lang": "zh-Hans"}], "error_code": null, "sha256": "7f56a53d74077d297316c1bb51c60f0570ce4b6c4db2579becb6f86cf11fce6b"}, "thread_id": "0b5bae29b98c4cf2a836ebafa5bfb5df", "expect": {"title": "泵组维护手册", "pages": [2], "revision": 1}, "diagnostics": {"schema_version": 1, "retrieval_trace": [{"tool_call_id": "call_00_nUHIFHTJtW5moGoupdfk3861", "query": "泵組壓力不足 P03-11 處理", "latency_ms": 85.082, "status": "OK", "reason": null, "required_identifiers": ["P03-11"], "missing_identifiers": [], "returned_chunk_ids": ["96e73d99eb9a4d4b9b5d22cbaf7bab5e", "7c1669ad838646fa9509d6c799897d79"]}, {"tool_call_id": "call_01_5H1PrCQhLdV7MpFqmGVO7023", "query": "P03-11 故障碼", "latency_ms": 76.083, "status": "OK", "reason": null, "required_identifiers": ["P03-11"], "missing_identifiers": [], "returned_chunk_ids": ["96e73d99eb9a4d4b9b5d22cbaf7bab5e", "7c1669ad838646fa9509d6c799897d79"]}], "model_declared_refusal": false, "model_finish_reason": "stop"}, "latency_ms": 2799.3}}
